#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:73
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Choose one of the built-in handles, *No Handle*, or *Custom*."
msgstr "Choisissez l'une des poignées intégrées, *No Handle* ou *Custom*."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:82
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Custom Handle"
msgstr "Custom Handle"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:79
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Use your own handle. Choose *Custom* and assign your objects to *Lever Geometry* and *Backplate Geometry*. Refer to :ref:`customization` on how to prepare them."
msgstr "Utilisez votre propre poignée. Choisissez *Custom* et assignez vos objets à *Lever Geometry* et *Backplate Geometry*. Pour les préparer, voir :ref:`customization`."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:88
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
